# HTTPS配置 > 私有CA配置 > Nginx使用CA证书

打开/etc/nginx/conf.d/default.conf文件，修改listen端口和server_name并使用CA签发的证书：

server {

listen 443 ssl;

#主机名（hostname查看）

server_name stamp;

# SSL证书配置

ssl_certificate /etc/nginx/ssl/stamp.crt;

ssl_certificate_key /etc/nginx/ssl/stamp.key;

# SSL协议配置

ssl_protocols TLSv1.2 TLSv1.3;

ssl_ciphers 'ECDHE-ECDSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-RSA-AES128-GCM-SHA256:ECDHE-ECDSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384:ECDHE-RSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384';

ssl_prefer_server_ciphers on;

ssl_session_cache shared:SSL:10m;

ssl_session_timeout 10m;

# 其他配置保持不变...

}

注：其他端口配置参照上述配置进行，80-86、88-89端口映射成https端口如下：

